Following workflow: **Analyze ledger + create projects and activities (Task 28)**

Let me start by fetching ledger postings for January and February 2026 expense accounts, and get an employee for project manager assignment.

**Step 1: GET ledger postings for both months + employee (in parallel)**
[2026-03-21T20:16:58.831Z] [STEP 2] calls: calculate({"expression":"\n// January totals by account\nconst jan = [\n  {number: 5000, name: \"Lønn til ansatte\", amount: 150000},\n  {number: 6300, name: \"Leie lokale\", amount: 4000},\n  {number: 6500, name: \"Motordrevet verktøy\", amount: 2400},\n  {number: 6300, name: \"Leie lokale\", amount: 12000},\n  {number: 7100, name: \"Bilgodtgjørelse oppgavepliktig\", amount: 5000},\n  {number: 7300, name: \"Salgskostnad\", amount: 6400},\n  {number: 7400, name: \"Kontingent, fradragsberettiget\", amount: 4800}\n];\n\nconst feb = [\n  {number: 5000, name: \"Lønn til ansatte\", amount: 155000},\n  {number: 6300, name: \"Leie lokale\", amount: 4500},\n  {number: 6500, name: \"Motordrevet verktøy\", amount: 8000},\n  {number: 6300, name: \"Leie lokale\", amount: 12000},\n  {number: 7100, name: \"Bilgodtgjørelse oppgavepliktig\", amount: 12000},\n  {number: 7300, name: \"Salgskostnad\", amount: 9600},\n  {number: 7400, name: \"Kontingent, fradragsberettiget\", amount: 5200}\n];\n\nconst agg = (arr) => {\n  const m = {};\n  arr.forEach(x => { m[x.number] = (m[x.number] || 0) + x.amount; });\n  return m;\n};\n\nconst janTotals = agg(jan);\nconst febTotals = agg(feb);\n\nconst allAccounts = [...new Set([...Object.keys(janTotals), ...Object.keys(febTotals)])];\nconst increases = allAccounts.map(num => ({\n  number: num,\n  jan: janTotals[num] || 0,\n  feb: febTotals[num] || 0,\n  increase: (febTotals[num] || 0) - (janTotals[num] || 0)\n})).sort((a, b) => b.increase - a.increase);\n\nJSON.stringify(increases.slice(0, 5))\n"})
